												<div id="earlyAccessHeader" class="early_access_header">
		<div class="heading">
												<h2 class="inset">Early Access Game</h2>
					<p class="inset subtitle">Get instant access and start playing; get involved with this game as it develops.</p>
				
				<p><span>Note:</span> Games in Early Access are not complete and may or may not change further. If you are not excited to play this game in its current state, then you
									should wait to see if the game progresses further in development. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/earlyaccessfaq/?snr=1_5_9_">Learn more</a></p>
					</div>
				<div id="earlyAccessBody" class="devnotes">
							<div class="devs_say">What the developers have to say:</div>
			
			<div id="devnotes_expander">
									<h3>Why Early Access?</h3>
					“DearBNB is already in a playable state, with its core gameplay mechanics and many features fully implemented. However, we believe there is still plenty of room to expand and improve the experience.<br />
During Early Access, we aim to refine existing systems, improve the overall gameplay experience, and expand the world of DearBNB with new content based on player feedback. Our goal is to create a richer, more enjoyable experience that continues to evolve together with our community.”
					<h3>Approximately how long will this game be in Early Access?</h3>
					“We plan to keep DearBNB in Early Access for approximately 6 months. However, this timeline may change depending on the development process and feedback from our community. Our priority is to deliver the best possible experience before transitioning to the full release.”
					<h3>How is the full version planned to differ from the Early Access version?</h3>
					“For the full release, we aim to expand the world of DearBNB with additional content and improved gameplay mechanics.<br />
<br />
We plan to introduce new areas, purchasable properties, furniture, decoration options, and quests. We also intend to refine the existing economy, property management, progression, and customization systems based on player feedback.<br />
<br />
Our goal is to offer a richer and more balanced experience, giving players even more possibilities as they build their own real estate empire. Planned features and development priorities may change throughout Early Access.”
					<h3>What is the current state of the Early Access version?</h3>
					“DearBNB currently offers a playable Early Access experience with its core gameplay loop fully implemented.<br />
<br />
Players can purchase houses, shops, and businesses across different areas, decorate and customize their properties, rent them out, and grow their real estate business by generating income.<br />
<br />
The game already includes a wide range of functional systems, such as furniture placement, room customization, cleaning, repairs, tenant management, finances, prestige, ranks, badges, skills, and quests.<br />
<br />
The current version offers a variety of content to enjoy for hours. However, as development is ongoing, players may still encounter occasional bugs or balancing issues. Throughout Early Access, we will focus on improving the existing experience and expanding the game with new content.”
					<h3>Will the game be priced differently during and after Early Access?</h3>
					“At the moment, we do not plan to change the game's base price during Early Access or after the full release. However, depending on the development process, additional content, and the overall scope of the game, we may reconsider our pricing strategy in the future. We aim to communicate any potential changes transparently with our community.”
					<h3>How are you planning on involving the Community in your development process?</h3>
					“Player feedback will play an important role in the ongoing development of DearBNB.<br />
<br />
We plan to actively listen to suggestions, bug reports, and player experiences through the Steam Community Hub and our feedback channels.<br />
<br />
Based on community feedback, we aim to improve gameplay mechanics, refine game balance, and prioritize future content updates. We also intend to keep our community informed about updates and development progress on a regular basis.<br />
<br />
Our goal is to work together with our players to make DearBNB an even more enjoyable and comprehensive experience.”
							</div> <!-- /devnotes_expander -->
			<a class="morebutton" id="devnotes_more" href="#"  onclick="$J('#devnotes_expander').css({'max-height': 'none'}); $J(this).hide(); return false;">Read more</a>
		</div>
	</div>
										
					
