				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;"></div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Dearbnb</strong> is a cozy management game where you build a real estate empire one room at a time.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Start your journey by renting a small apartment in a modest neighborhood. Carefully decorate rooms, place furniture freely, set prices, and welcome tenants and customers. As you gain experience and reputation, unlock new zones — from poor districts to luxury neighborhoods and expand into residences, shops, and massive commercial properties.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every room matters.<br>Every decision shapes your path to becoming a true property tycoon.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Buy, Decorate &amp; Rent</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Purchase apartments, houses, residences, and commercial properties.<br>Place furniture freely in dedicated room scenes.No construction stress, just cozy design.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.poster.avif?t=1793260712" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.webm?t=1793260712" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.mp4?t=1793260712" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Interior Customization &amp; Cozy Design</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Customize every room exactly the way you want. <br>Change <strong>wall colors</strong>, <strong>floor materials</strong>, and freely place <strong>furniture and decorative items</strong> to shape the atmosphere of each space. <br>Every design choice affects comfort, property value, and customer satisfaction.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Create warm, minimal, luxury, or playful interiors your style defines your success.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.poster.avif?t=1793260712" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.webm?t=1793260712" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.mp4?t=1793260712" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" > Room-Based Gameplay</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Click on a room to enter a focused decorating scene.<br>When your setup is complete, hit <strong>“Ready”</strong> and watch tenants and customers arrive.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Zone Progression</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Start in lower income districts and work your way up to elite neighborhoods.<br>Higher zones require experience, skills, and special badges to unlock.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Skill Tree &amp; Badge System</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unlock new regions, property types, and business opportunities through progression and achievements.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Beyond Apartments</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Manage cafes, shops, theme park, supermarket, cinema, aquapark and more. <br>Expand businesses, increase capacity, and optimize income streams.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.poster.avif?t=1793260712" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.webm?t=1793260712" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.mp4?t=1793260712" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Lively Characters</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Watch tenants shower, relax, work, and interact with your spaces sometimes in surprising and funny ways.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Cozy Yet Strategic</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >No pressure, no combat.<br>A relaxing atmosphere combined with meaningful management decisions.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.poster.avif?t=1793260712" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.webm?t=1793260712" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338180/extras/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.mp4?t=1793260712" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
